.TH WIFI-HOTSPOT-ENABLE-EXTENSION 1 "2026-10-29" "RelayForge 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wifi-hotspot-enable-extension \- enable the RelayForge GNOME Shell extension
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wifi-hotspot-enable-extension
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B wifi-hotspot-enable-extension
enables the bundled GNOME Shell extension
.I wifi-relay@3togo.github.io
so that the Wi\-Fi Relay indicator appears in the GNOME top bar. It is invoked by
the first\-login dispatcher after installation. On desktops other than GNOME the
tray indicator provides the same controls.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR wifi-hotspot-tray (1),
.BR relayforge-service (8)
